<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels continue offensive in eastern DRC, seizing towns and planning 3,300 houses to ease the Goma housing crisis, while ADF gunmen keep killing civilians in Ituri province. The FARDC was blamed for bombing a school in Minembwe, leaving 738 students without classes. Rwanda is preparing to serve as a European deportation hub for asylum seekers, prompting diplomatic protest from the DRC. The Kinshasa blind spot analysis notes that Kenya-DRC détente requires broader regional cooperation. 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNcS11cVFvdkxIb204RHl5SktwRVRZeE4xMjY3YmZBRW9WYlNldEJqN1FBdG1iRlZxSGhLd2k3WTZodnlzbWNNMU5fdmxySmdJLVdMcGJSeFEtSGphYjVjRExzbkxtSWZFY1RjTXppWVJXSXVhVEUwNGNKdnRQVk1uTTFSVTZSSXE0Y2h6bjVuLU1HVEpoa1AxSGxBWUhOTlhhMVFrM1BVWlE0em8taGdPMzBGRVo0UXExaFVKeHIweEg3cnJJWkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNUHl5VTFqUHZ2ekdZSDg2UG0tX1lQNXJHU25mOU9MUXdOQy01Z3VnVG5nWjVaaWxDazBqRUJJQW0yTjZERXNrb0NHSE5PYnRzZTFYMV80dFpHbGRyeVUwajR1SW43LThrODRNT0VuRGNzSE1IaXdPc1pzcTg0dXNRNko3SFJaVGFUYzIzbkg1ekdWVkJtMUtHdmNnaGFDZmloMXVxLUJ6TF9tbHBvcTRFVk9RVVVlVUg2QklremVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;RTL Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE5Bc0IxYnNrS1E2UGhzYlJIQk5kUWVVb2FUMjROREpUQUkyZ2ZrM3BsS0lEQXRpWVZ2WXhXbXlpN3pHSWhSdjFHUjYwb2psUkhGWWlKTU5CWG9oazZKZDJfYUh3U0JNR0VJXzMzT0Rn?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQUENBemZManpUalNQZS1MaXlHVXlqdzhtX2xYT0RtaGdPSmlwdlphd3lqNG04Z2lldUlDSkZ3eVZYZm5tV2xvV1pidU1HM1FNektzcUI4MGR2VVlsN3